  "decision": {
    "summary": "The PR66 exporter is useful as a read-only accountability shell. It clearly reports run identity, safe artifact presence, malformed and missing artifact states, custody flags, and limitations without raw content or scoring. The main review finding is that empty PR31 buckets are safe but only partly clear in real archive exports because they can look like no deltas rather than no labels supplied to the exporter.",
    "recommended_next_slice": "PR68 Audit Decision Record Schema/Exporter Refinement v0",
    "recommended_next_slice_reason": "Before archive integration or batch review export, add or design a clearer population-policy/status cue for PR31 buckets and semantic fields so empty arrays cannot be mistaken for a substantive no-delta judgment."
